l, that is fine, what happened was malice and treatwere in the arena and I was watching the battle over malices shoulder.I watched treat sidestep a backstab, which made no sense whatsoever to me.  When i asked him how he did ithe refused to cooperate, so i asked him if it was a skill, and if it wasthat it would suffice, he told me it was a skill, so i asked him what that skill was, he wouldn't tell me (telling me, of course, would havessettled this without you and I even having to discuss it, I think this is,btw, a very valid skill.  Thanks for the info, i wont be coding around the spell, i think it is very valid,but I do have one question: What level does a bard have to bein order to get that skill and does it take the attackers levelinto account, I think it should, that way lvl 22 bards arent dodging attacksfrom L10 thieves (just an example).  Thanks turboThe sprain**brainsprain**To: airborneSubj: First goldsun areaCc: archesDate: Apr 14I have revised the first of goldsun's area .. the poorly named7-islands (since there are only 6)  However, I have my ownarea, a huge island, that i am going to rebuild into the 7th island.  That aside, I would like to get the area putinto play as soon as possible, it is in:/players/brainsprain/goldsun/7-islands/**"
